-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/bfd-state/", "title": "BFD_SESSION_TABLE (STATE_DB)", "content_html": "STATE_DB BFD_SESSION_TABLE \u2014 bfdorch \u304c SAI \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u4f5c\u6210\u5f8c\u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080 BFD \u30bb\u30c3\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u72b6\u614b\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u3002SAI \u901a\u77e5\u53d7\u4fe1\u3054\u3068\u306b state \u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u304c\u66f4\u65b0\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/bfd-state.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T00:54:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T01:55:55+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/cbf-nhg/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/cbf-nhg/", "title": "CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "CLASS_BASED_NEXT_HOP_GROUP \u2014 Class Based Forwarding (CBF) \u7528\u306e\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u6b21\u30db\u30c3\u30d7\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3092 APPL_DB \u306b\u4fdd\u6301\u3059\u308b\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3002cbfnhgorch (sonic-swss) \u304c\u8aad\u307f\u51fa\u3057\u3066 SAI NHG \u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u30fb\u524a\u9664\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/cbf-nhg.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T00:54:09+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T01:53:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-state/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/copp-state/", "title": "STATE_DB COPP \u72b6\u614b\u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "STATE_DB \u306e COPP_GROUP_TABLE / COPP_TRAP_TABLE / COPP_TRAP_CAPABILITY_TABLE \u2014 CoPP \u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u30fb\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u9069\u7528\u72b6\u614b\u306