official-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch-event/", "title": "RouteOrch event / notification (ResponsePublisher + NextHopObserver)", "content_html": "orchagent RouteOrch \u304c\u9001\u51fa\u3059\u308b 2 \u7a2e\u985e\u306e\u901a\u77e5\u6a5f\u69cb\u2014APPL_STATE_DB \u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u307f + RESPONSE_CHANNEL\uff08ResponsePublisher \u7d4c\u7531\uff09\u3068\u5185\u90e8 NextHopObserver\u2014\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u3068\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u7531\u6765\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u3092\u8a73\u89e3\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/route-orch-event.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T00:35:40+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-15T02:09:01+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-orch/", "title": "FLOW_COUNTER_ROUTE_PATTERN (RouteOrch / FlowCounterRouteOrch)", "content_html": "orchagent \u306e RouteOrch \u304a\u3088\u3073 FlowCounterRouteOrch \u304c\u53c2\u7167\u3059\u308b CONFIG_DB \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb FLOW_COUNTER_ROUTE_PATTERN \u306e\u69cb\u9020\u30fb\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u3068\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u7531\u6765\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u3092\u8a73\u89e3\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/route-orch.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T00:35:40+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-14T13:57:07+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-rule/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/route-rule/", "title": "DASH_ROUTE_RULE_TABLE \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb", "content_html": "DASH_ROUTE_RULE_T